import{_ as i,o as t,c as o,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 506 | Origin Acceleration Domain | Distribution Mechanism for Myriad-Races-Shared Acceleration Resources","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 506 | Origin Acceleration Domain | Distribution Mechanism for Myriad-Races-Shared Acceleration Resources","no":506,"module":3,"tags":["Origin Acceleration Domain","Resource Allocation","Joint Contracting","Myriad Races Shared","Civilizational Weight"],"related":["22-Resource-Distribution Joint-Contracting Mechanism","06-More-Work-More-Pay Distribution Principle","94-Myriad-Races Roster"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0506_模块3-加速资源万族分配机制.md","filePath":"en/0506_模块3-加速资源万族分配机制.md"}'),n={name:"en/0506_模块3-加速资源万族分配机制.md"};function r(s,e,c,l,u,d){return t(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-506-origin-acceleration-domain-distribution-mechanism-for-myriad-races-shared-acceleration-resources" tabindex="-1">Entry 506 | Origin Acceleration Domain | Distribution Mechanism for Myriad-Races-Shared Acceleration Resources <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-506-origin-acceleration-domain-distribution-mechanism-for-myriad-races-shared-acceleration-resources" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 506 | Origin Acceleration Domain | Distribution Mechanism for Myriad-Races-Shared Acceleration Resources&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 22, 06, 94</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-fast-resources-—-on-what-grounds-to-whom" tabindex="-1">Introduction: fast resources — on what grounds to whom <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-fast-resources-—-on-what-grounds-to-whom" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: fast resources — on what grounds to whom&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin Acceleration Domain&#39;s scarcest resource is not devices, but <strong>acceleration time</strong>. Law-resonance bandwidth, isolated-space compute, consciousness-domain energy supply — each is a hard constraint. If distribution is unfair, the Acceleration Domain will degenerate into strong ones&#39; private club; the entire dual-track time domain&#39;s design becomes void. Six top-level axioms are the distribution mechanism&#39;s constitution: anti-predation axiom requires acceleration resources reward only incremental contribution, not predatory gains; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires five gene lineages, men and women, old and young, Youth Supremes and ordinary beings treated equally; collective ascension axiom requires acceleration resources tilt toward the direction of &quot;lifting Myriad Ranks up together&quot;; causal self-discipline axiom requires distribution process public and auditable; law-first axiom requires distribution algorithm stable and recalculable, not ad hoc favoritism. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This article decomposes the Origin Acceleration Domain&#39;s distribution mechanism.</p><h2 id="i-three-rulers-of-distribution" tabindex="-1">I. Three Rulers of Distribution <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-three-rulers-of-distribution" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Three Rulers of Distribution&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Acceleration resource distribution does not look at birth, does not look at cultivation level, only at three rulers:</p><ol><li><strong>Civilizational contribution</strong>: accounted by the Joint Contracting mechanism (Document 22), recording the individual&#39;s incremental contribution to the symbiotic network — what was developed, how many lives saved, how many law anchors repaired;</li><li><strong>Task publicness</strong>: the more public the task, the higher the priority. Saving a plane&#39;s disaster has priority over an individual&#39;s closed-door breakthrough;</li><li><strong>Racial coverage</strong>: to ensure 99% full coverage, each Acceleration-Domain quota must reserve a certain proportion for historically marginalized races and individuals.</li></ol><p>Three rulers combined constitute the &quot;contribution—publicness—coverage&quot; three-dimensional score. This score determines who can open which gear, for how long.</p><h2 id="ii-differentiated-conversion-across-the-five-gene-lineages" tabindex="-1">II. Differentiated Conversion Across the Five Gene Lineages <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-differentiated-conversion-across-the-five-gene-lineages" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Differentiated Conversion Across the Five Gene Lineages&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Different races&#39; &quot;acceleration time&quot; value differs; distribution must convert:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Lineage</th><th>Time Conversion Coefficient</th><th>Note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Carbon-based matter race</td><td>1.0</td><td>Baseline</td></tr><tr><td>Energy-condensation race</td><td>0.7</td><td>Consciousness naturally active; higher efficiency under same compute</td></tr><tr><td>Mechanical-construction race</td><td>1.3</td><td>Needs extra energy for chip computation; slightly higher conversion</td></tr><tr><td>Consciousness-information race</td><td>0.5</td><td>Almost pure consciousness existence; extremely high acceleration efficiency</td></tr><tr><td>Mixed-variant race</td><td>1.0–1.5</td><td>Case-by-case accounting by composition ratio</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Conversion coefficients ensure &quot;high-efficiency races&quot; do not monopolize resources because they are cheap, and &quot;low-efficiency races&quot; are not squeezed out of the Acceleration Domain because they are expensive. This is the republican axiom of Myriad Races&#39;s precise implementation at the distribution layer.</p><h2 id="iii-quotas-rotation-and-relief" tabindex="-1">III. Quotas, Rotation, and Relief <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-quotas-rotation-and-relief" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Quotas, Rotation, and Relief&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Base quota</strong>: every being meeting the admission threshold gets a base acceleration time per year, ensuring everyone has some to use;</li><li><strong>Contribution redemption</strong>: exceeding the base quota redeemed with civilizational contribution; more work more gain;</li><li><strong>Rotation system</strong>: popular gears (100× and above) use queued rotation, eliminating strong ones&#39; long-term occupation;</li><li><strong>Relief channel</strong>: planes or races facing civilization-level crisis may apply for emergency quotas, dispatched with priority after Anchor Supervisory Committee approval.</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-tang-luo-s-resource-master-lineage-system" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Tang Luo&#39;s &quot;Resource Master-Lineage System&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-tang-luo-s-resource-master-lineage-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Tang Luo&#39;s &quot;Resource Master-Lineage System&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the Tang Luo system, cultivation resources (including closed-door chambers, time-accelerated ley lines) are distributed by master-lineage, bloodline, contribution (to the sect); outer factions have almost no access. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s distribution mechanism replaces &quot;sect loyalty&quot; with &quot;civilizational contribution,&quot; replaces &quot;bloodline&quot; with &quot;coverage,&quot; replaces &quot;exclusive occupation&quot; with &quot;rotation.&quot; A carbon-based youth from a remote plane, as long as he makes enough civilizational contribution, can queue in the same line as a Transform-Origin strong one.</p><h2 id="v-grievance-and-dynamic-adjustment-of-distribution" tabindex="-1">V. Grievance and Dynamic Adjustment of Distribution <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-grievance-and-dynamic-adjustment-of-distribution" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Grievance and Dynamic Adjustment of Distribution&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Distribution is not set once. Every quarter, the Anchor Supervisory Committee reviews distribution results: if a race&#39;s actual usage long-term falls below quota, quota is too high; if a task type long-term cannot queue in, quota is too low. Review results public; Myriad-Rank representatives may propose adjustment motions at the Anchor Council. This dynamic adjustment ensures the distribution mechanism does not rigidify after a few years of operation, nor is it solidified into a new class by vested interests. Any being who believes they are unfairly excluded from a path may file a grievance with the Symbiotic Court; the Court has the right to require recalculation of their contribution and quota.</p><h3 id="common-misconceptions-in-distribution-clarified" tabindex="-1">Common Misconceptions in Distribution Clarified <a class="header-anchor" href="#common-misconceptions-in-distribution-clarified" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Common Misconceptions in Distribution Clarified&quot;">​</a></h3><p>During execution, three misconceptions need repeated clarification: first, &quot;is base quota equal to egalitarianism&quot; — no, base quota only guarantees entry rights; excess still redeemed by contribution; second, &quot;will disadvantaged races be specially favored&quot; — no special favoritism, but coverage correction, purpose is to make up historical arrears, not undifferentiated concession; third, &quot;can quota be transferred&quot; — no, acceleration time is tied to real-name identity; transfer is deemed covert trade, auto-identified by the Alaya Network. Clarifying these three is the premise for the distribution mechanism not being corrupted long-term.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: three-dimensional score directs acceleration time to the most public, highest-contribution tasks; eliminates strong ones hoarding</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: predatory gains do not count toward contribution; resources accumulated by devouring cannot redeem acceleration time</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s resources distributed by master-lineage; outer generations cannot catch up; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s resources distributed by contribution and coverage; newcomers and old races compete on the same field</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: differentiated conversion + base quota + relief channel, ensuring 99% races and individuals can actually enter the Acceleration Domain</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: distribution algorithm, conversion coefficients, queue rules all public; newly merged planes connect per the same rules</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Acceleration-resource distribution is the touchstone of whether the dual-track time domain truly belongs to Myriad Ranks. Three rulers — contribution, publicness, coverage — plus five gene-lineage differentiated conversion, make &quot;fast&quot; for the first time a public good of Myriad Ranks, not strong ones&#39; private property.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./22-资源分配联产承包机制.html">22-Resource-Distribution Joint-Contracting Mechanism</a> · <a href="./06-多劳多得分配原理.html">06-More-Work-More-Pay Distribution Principle</a> · <a href="./94-万族名录.html">94-Myriad-Races Roster</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const g=i(n,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
